<back><div type="verses">
<lg><l>From mountains to-o the seas,</l><l>Flowers, bugs, rocks, webs, grass, shells, stars and trees.</l><l>God’s design we-e can see</l><l>In things great and small, created for me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
